oss":"food"}],"gloss":"scratched-up food"},{"surface":"மிச்சில்","parts":[{"text":"மிச்சில்","lemma":"miccil","gloss":"leftover"}],"gloss":"leftover"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குளவி","parts":[{"text":"குளவி","lemma":"kuḷavi","gloss":"wild jasmine"}],"gloss":"wild jasmine"},{"surface":"மொய்த்த","parts":[{"text":"மொய்","lemma":"moy","gloss":"swarm"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"tta","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"swarmed"},{"surface":"அழுகல்","parts":[{"text":"அழுகல்","lemma":"aḻukal","gloss":"decayed/muddy"}],"gloss":"muddy/decayed"},{"surface":"சில்","parts":[{"text":"சில்","lemma":"cil","gloss":"small quantity"}],"gloss":"small quantity of"},{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வளை","parts":[{"text":"வளை","lemma":"vaḷai","gloss":"bangle"}],"gloss":"bangle"},{"surface":"உடை","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing"},{"surface":"கையள்","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"kai","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she-suffix"}],"gloss":"she of the hands"},{"surface":"எம்மோடு","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"em","gloss":"us"},{"text":"ஓடு","lemma":"ōṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with us"},{"surface":"உணீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"uṇ","gloss":"drink/eat"},{"text":"ஈஇயர்","lemma":"īiyar","gloss":"in order to"}],"gloss":"in order to drink"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருக","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"come"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may she come"},{"surface":"தில்","parts":[{"text":"தில்","lemma":"til","gloss":"particle of desire"}],"gloss":"indeed (expressing hope)"},{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"amma","gloss":"exclamatary particle"}],"gloss":"ah"},{"surface":"தானே","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"self"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"herself indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அளியளோ","parts":[{"text":"அளியளோ","lemma":"அளியளோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அளியளெந்","parts":[{"text":"அளியளெந்","lemma":"அளியளெந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெஞ்சமர்ந்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சமர்ந்","lemma":"நெஞ்சமர்ந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோளே","parts":[{"text":"தோளே","lemma":"தோளே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Hunting red dog scratched-and-eaten leftover / wild-jasmine swarmed muddy small-water / bangle-possessing handed-she with-us to-drink / may-she-come indeed, ah, herself! / Is she to be pitied? She is tender, she who resided in my heart!","translation":"May she, who wears bangles on her hands, come with us to drink the tiny amount of muddy water swarmed by wild jasmine, left over after a hunting red dog scratched and ate! How tender she is, she who has taken her abode in my heart!","modern":"வேட்டையாடும் செந்நாய் தோண்டித் தின்றதன் மிச்சமாக உள்ளதும், காட்டு மல்லிகை மொய்க்கின்ற அழுகிய சேறு கலந்த சிறிய அளவு நீரை, வளையல் அணிந்த கைகளை உடைய என் தலைவி என்னோடு சேர்ந்து குடிப்பதற்காக வரட்டும். என் நெஞ்சில் அமர்ந்திருக்கும் அவள் எவ்வளவு எளியவள்! எவ்வளவு அன்பிற்குரியவள்!","explanation":"This poem is set in the arid wasteland (pālai) landscape, spoken by the hero who is eloping with his beloved. As they journey through the harsh desert, they find only a tiny puddle of muddy water, which has been scratched up by a wild red dog and is covered with fallen wild jasmine flowers. Despite the poor quality and scarcity of the water, the hero wishes for his delicate, bangle-clad beloved to share this meager drink with him. He marvels at her tenderness and willingness to endure such hardships for his sake, expressing his deep love and concern for her. The contrast between her delicate nature ('bangle-wearing hands') and the harsh reality of the wasteland ('muddy water left by a wild dog') highlights the intensity of her love and his protective affection.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.4],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.45],[3.58,4.2],[4.2,5.03],[5.03,5.2],[6.98,8.04],[8.04,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,8.7],[8.7,9.87],[10.7,11.0],[11.0,11.4],[11.4,11.65]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.8],[1.8,2.2],[2.2,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.87],[4.03,4.5],[4.5,5.4],[5.4,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,6.8],[6.8,7.9],[7.9,8.0],[8.0,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,10.8],[10.8,11.4]]}}